{"id":"c693f2be3a15968b","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Characteristic Set","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set — ZFC Pcf3 Characteristic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set — ZFC Pcf3 Characteristic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set — ZFC Pcf3 Characteristic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\chi\\in V\">\\(A,\\chi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\">\\(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> is the possible-cofinality spectrum</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\land\\chi=\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\land\\chi=\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “characteristic set” is the PCF spectrum of the progressive set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>. Regularity is stated with the canonical predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\)</span> rather than treating that predicate as a set-valued constant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\chi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|<\\min(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CharacteristicSet}_S(A,\\chi)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|<\\min(A)\\land\\chi=\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":1079,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3059","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set.md|58-df-zfc-pcf3-characteristic-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50"]}